WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:04.580
Prince Siegwald, please do something!

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:08.380
Lady Lieselotte is picking on that Fiene girl again!

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:11.920
Prince Siegwald?

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.420
Thank you for letting me know.

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.170
I'll go check on the situation.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:20.880
Ah, well. So many seem to
misunderstand my dear fiancée.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.500
If they only knew she's a "tsun de rais",
they would see just how cute she is.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.710
Oh! There he is, our main man Prince Sieg!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.170
Your timing couldn't be better!

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.040
Lord Endoh and Lady Kobayashee!

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:42.790
M...Miss Fiene. I understand you live
in the faculty dorms at present.

00:00:43.080 --> 00:00:46.080
I do! They're letting me live there for really cheap.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:47.290
So tell me...

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:51.040
do they serve meals in the dorms?

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:52.040
Huh?

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:54.250
Oh uh, yes! They're tasty, too!

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.170
But they don't have quite as much meat as I'd like...

00:00:58.420 --> 00:01:00.580
And the dining hall there is always open?

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:01.290
Uh?

00:01:01.670 --> 00:01:05.920
With not a day off, whether
it's spring, summer, fall, or winter?

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.750
Umm...

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:13.250
Looks like Lieselotte wants to ask Fiene something,
but I have no idea what she's getting at!

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:16.380
She's so roundabout,
this just sounds like an interrogation!

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:22.750
Ienai kimochi ni kizuite

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:28.880
Ibitsu de bukiyou na kotoba de tsutaeru kara

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:32.040
Kitto kimi ni

00:01:41.290 --> 00:01:44.330
Itsumo gomakashichau yo

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:46.710
(Doki doki barenai youni)

00:01:46.790 --> 00:01:51.920
Zenbu mabushisugiru kimi no sei dayo

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.960
Kawaiku nante narenaiyo

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.710
(Datte niawanai desho?)

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.540
Sono me ni utsuru sora mo

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:02.830
Massugu mitsumerarenakute

00:02:02.830 --> 00:02:08.170
Uso darake no sekai ni itsumade iru no?

00:02:08.170 --> 00:02:13.080
Kono mamaja nanimo kaerarenai

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:15.790
Sonna no iya dayo

00:02:15.790 --> 00:02:21.920
Moshimo kamisama ga kimochi tsugete kuretatoshitemo

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:27.250
Itsuka jibun no koe de kimi no koto ga suki dato tsutaetai

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:36.000
Moshimo ibitsudemo taisetsu na omoi dokoka kiechau mae ni

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:39.210
Yuuki dasu kara

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:53.540
<b>The Summer, Going Home, and Missing You</b>

00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:55.540
Hi there, you two.

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.080
Your Highness!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:00.580
What's this about the dining hall in the faculty dorms?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:04.040
Oh, I suppose with summer break coming up...

00:03:04.330 --> 00:03:05.290
Hmm?

00:03:06.170 --> 00:03:08.330
...I believe the dining hall will be closed then.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:14.080
Oh, I see now. So Lieselotte wanted to ask Fiene
how she was going to spend summer break!

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:16.330
Great job, Sieg! Way to help her out!

00:03:16.630 --> 00:03:20.080
Well, I figure I can cook for myself
in the dorms over the break.

00:03:20.080 --> 00:03:22.960
On your own? Are you not returning home?

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:25.790
I don't really have a home to go back to, actually.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:31.880
My mother raised me on her own,
but I'm not even sure where she is at the moment.

00:03:32.330 --> 00:03:34.500
Does she mean her mother is missing?

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:39.330
Well, some people are after my mother's life, you see.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:43.960
Apparently she once made a very powerful noble angry,

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.750
so I've almost gotten killed myself,

00:03:46.750 --> 00:03:48.960
and we moved locations on a monthly basis.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:53.330
Ever since I started at the academy,
she won't even tell me where she's gone.

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:58.080
I really wonder what she could have
done to get into such a mess.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.080
This is no laughing matter!

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:07.540
You intend on staying in the dorms alone
despite all of that? Consider the risk!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.420
S-s-s-s-sorry!

00:04:09.420 --> 00:04:12.670
But umm, well, uh... I really have nowhere else....

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:16.330
You may be adept at fighting,
but I dare say that has made you complacent.

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:22.330
<b>The Royal Academy of Magic-Courtyard</b>

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:22.330
<b>Lieselotte</b>

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:22.330
<b>You may be adept at fighting, but I dare say that has made you complacent.</b>

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:19.000
Why is she so mad about this?

00:04:19.000 --> 00:04:22.330
I think she's trying to cover up
her shock over Fiene's rough upbringing,

00:04:22.500 --> 00:04:27.330
but also annoyed that Fiene doesn't think
to rely on others despite her situation.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:32.920
In other words, she sympathizes with Fiene and
wants to help her out. The "tsun" in tsundere!

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.080
I knew it!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:39.000
In that case, Lieselotte, why not let
Fiene stay in the security of your home?

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:39.880
Huh?

00:04:40.750 --> 00:04:43.460
You're retuning to your family estate
for the summer, are you not?

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:47.960
It would give me peace of mind if
you could take Miss Fiene along with you.

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:51.880
Oh, I-I couldn't impose on her like that!

00:04:51.880 --> 00:04:57.380
What a splendid idea! The Riefenstahls take pride
in our engagement in the military arts.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:00.960
No other place would be as safe or secure.

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:06.500
I have three sisters as well, so another
addition wouldn't make much difference!

00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:17.630
Not that I mind either way, but if Your Highness insists,
I see no reason... to refuse... her...

00:05:18.710 --> 00:05:25.330
There it is! A rapid-fire response that fails to hide
her joy despite her haughty choice of words!

00:05:25.330 --> 00:05:27.170
Followed up by...

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:33.250
toning things down at the end after realizing she got
too excited, for a ten out of ten tsundere performance!

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:34.290
But I see now.

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:39.080
Liese-tan's goal was to invite Fiene
to her home from the very beginning!

00:05:41.330 --> 00:05:45.250
My fiancée is so adorable it hurts!

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:49.750
I really appreciate the offer,
but I couldn't possibly ask that of her.

00:05:49.920 --> 00:05:53.170
Miss Fiene, the Riefenstahl estate
is located by the ocean.

00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.130
You'll be able to enjoy some very fresh seafood.

00:05:56.130 --> 00:05:56.630
Huh?!

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.460
The territory is renowned for its dairy as well,
and they also have some delicious meat-

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.920
I would be honored, Lady Lieselotte!

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:05.540
Y-you have quite the voracious appetite.

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:06.330
Miss Fiene!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.210
Baldur!

00:06:10.540 --> 00:06:16.580
Oh... uh... I-I'm very sorry! I left something
in the classroom. Please excuse me!

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:20.290
Ooh, that's awkward.

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:24.040
She's been blatantly avoiding Bal
since what happened the other day.

00:06:25.670 --> 00:06:30.880
W-will you be going around inspecting the various
estates over the summer as usual, Your Highness?

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:33.080
Why yes, on my father's behalf.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:37.710
Will you be... coming through
the Riefenstahl estate, perchance?

00:06:37.710 --> 00:06:38.380
No.

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:45.330
The Riefenstahl estate is exemplary and worthy of trust.
There's no need for an inspection.

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:50.750
I must question your decision to put
such unfettered faith in my family's affairs!

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:56.250
Aw, Liese-tan! You're sad that you won't be able
to see Sieg over the summer, aren't you?!

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:59.920
I am too... to be honest...

00:07:01.290 --> 00:07:03.460
Lieselotte, I'll write.

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:05.500
You needn't go out of your way.

00:07:05.500 --> 00:07:09.250
If you do have that kind of time,
you should use it to get some proper rest.

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.920
All right, then. I will.

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.210
You can see it coming up.

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:30.960
Wow...!

00:07:49.880 --> 00:07:53.830
The twins Adelina and Katrina, and the youngest, Cecilie.

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:55.750
We're delighted to meet you.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:07:58.670
Th-thank you for having me.

00:07:58.670 --> 00:08:00.960
I would introduce you to my father as well,

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:05.250
but I'm sorry to say he's out inspecting our territory
and won't return for at least half a month.

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.130
Allow me to take you to your room.

00:08:08.830 --> 00:08:11.710
Oh, uh, I-I can carry that myself!

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:14.580
Once you are settled in,
please make yourself over to the hall.

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:16.210
We shall serve some tea.

00:08:16.210 --> 00:08:18.460
Oh, thank you very much.

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:20.580
Please excuse me.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:24.130
Whew!

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:29.790
Ooh, it's like a cloud! This feels so nice!

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:37.830
Uh... Th-the hall?

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:40.580
Where is that?!

00:08:44.330 --> 00:08:47.000
I cannot believe you managed to get lost.

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:53.130
I see no choice but to prepare
a room for you next to my own.

00:08:53.130 --> 00:08:54.750
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:55.500
And another thing.

00:08:56.330 --> 00:09:01.330
I'll have you know that just because it's summer break
doesn't mean you can afford to spend it frivolously.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:06.130
You are going to learn behavior that befits a proper lady.

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.330
A-a "proper lady"?

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:14.130
Oh, but... a humble commoner like me, a proper lady?
I don't think that's possible.

00:09:14.290 --> 00:09:15.380
I don't want to hear it!

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:21.960
I expect any guest of this house to be able
to command a baseline level of etiquette!

00:09:22.460 --> 00:09:26.750
Besides, have you given any thought
about your plans for the future?

00:09:27.290 --> 00:09:29.250
My... future?

00:09:29.960 --> 00:09:34.130
Um, I'd like to learn how to use
magic properly at the academy

00:09:34.130 --> 00:09:36.920
and once I graduate, maybe I'll become
an adventurer or something-

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:38.170
How very naïve!

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:43.420
Adventuring is dangerous, and once your
fitness wanes your income will plunge.

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:46.420
Then you'll meet your demise on
the side of the road at the very best!

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:51.830
You show promise in healing magic and know how
to defend yourself using your own fighting technique.

00:09:52.170 --> 00:09:56.250
I'm sure plenty of nobles and affluent merchants-
actually, even those of higher status-

00:09:56.580 --> 00:10:00.580
will wish to hire you to protect their wives and daughters.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:01.250
Huh?!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:07.380
That is, only if you are able to carry yourself without
embarrassing yourself in public, of course!

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:12.540
Can you believe it?! Apparently,
Liese-tan's even worried about Fiene's future!

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:15.250
Ah, so that's what she means!

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:16.710
But shoot...

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:20.000
Without Sieg around, we can't tell anyone!

00:10:21.040 --> 00:10:23.830
How could we be so powerless?!

00:10:23.830 --> 00:10:27.580
We need you to hurry and get here, Sieg!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:44.420
I thought these inspections would
be much more laid back.

00:10:44.420 --> 00:10:46.210
What made you think that?

00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:50.630
Art, I bet you just tagged along
to get out of your holy duties.

00:10:50.630 --> 00:10:52.080
O-of course not!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:53.580
Ooh!

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:56.420
Wow, what beautiful fabric.

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:59.210
But the true beauty here is you.

00:10:59.210 --> 00:11:01.000
Must you always do this?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.790
I'm sure this would look good on her.

00:11:29.210 --> 00:11:30.080
Liese...

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.500
This is so lovely!

00:11:39.540 --> 00:11:41.250
That again?

00:11:41.250 --> 00:11:45.380
You've been here two weeks and
I think that's all you've said.

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:47.960
It really is lovely, though.

00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:51.790
Both the scenery and getting to stay in a castle like this.

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.420
Huh...

00:11:54.880 --> 00:11:55.790
Miss Fiene!

00:11:56.380 --> 00:11:59.250
Adelina! Katrina! Cecilie!

00:11:59.580 --> 00:12:00.880
Time for tea, everyone!

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:04.540
Uh, what? They're so fast at getting away!

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:24.290
You've gotten quite a bit better at carrying yourself.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:26.130
Uh, right.

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:29.630
Don't pour so quickly!

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:30.460
R-right!

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.580
That's far too much sugar!

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.920
Aghh, right!

00:12:35.460 --> 00:12:39.210
Don't attempt to eat it in one bite!
And look at your posture! Straighten your back!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:40.630
Okay...!

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:44.750
Although I didn't know what I would
do with you when you first arrived.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:47.040
Oh no, I still have a lot to learn.

00:12:47.290 --> 00:12:52.170
Oh, you needn't be modest.
You're quite the fast learner, Miss Fiene.

00:12:52.750 --> 00:12:55.920
I can tell you're putting in due effort on a daily basis.

00:12:56.170 --> 00:12:58.080
Oh... thank you.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:05.380
This is so good! I couldn't think about
the taste just a moment ago,

00:13:05.630 --> 00:13:08.580
but it's sophisticated and clean
on the palate with a brisk flavor.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:11.920
And there's a gentleness that underlies it all.

00:13:13.250 --> 00:13:15.710
I suddenly remembered something from my childhood.

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:16.460
Oh?

00:13:16.460 --> 00:13:21.130
Once every week, my mother
designated a day for playing princess.

00:13:21.710 --> 00:13:24.420
It was this game we played where I had
to copy my mother's actions and speech

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.130
as she pretended to be a princess.

00:13:27.710 --> 00:13:29.460
I took it very seriously.

00:13:29.920 --> 00:13:33.460
Well, because if I did well
I would get a more exciting dinner.

00:13:35.080 --> 00:13:36.380
Your mother sounds wonderful.

00:13:36.380 --> 00:13:37.420
You remind me of her.

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:38.130
Oh?

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:43.380
Your mannerisms are like when
my mother was playing princess.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:51.210
But I don't understand why my mother made me do that.

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:54.790
It's a bit ludicrous if you think about it, isn't it?

00:13:55.670 --> 00:14:00.000
Getting to spend my days here in
such splendor has really made me realize

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:05.210
that as a commoner, the life I lead is worlds
apart from your family's, Lady Lieselotte.

00:14:07.500 --> 00:14:09.920
And from Sir Bal's, as well.

00:14:10.630 --> 00:14:12.540
Did something happen between you and Bal?

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.130
A-although I don't mean to pry if it's a personal matter!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:20.130
O-oh, um...!

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:26.290
W...well... actually...

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.080
Bal... really told you that?

00:14:33.540 --> 00:14:37.040
I'm well aware of my position in the social hierarchy.

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:38.540
But despite that...

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:43.790
I fail to imagine that there would be anyone
in the world as charming as you.

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:46.460
Set your mind at ease and let me protect you.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:51.330
He... p-practically professed his love for me.
I don't know what to do.

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:52.080
Uh?

00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:54.630
Um, Lady Lieselotte?!

00:14:55.170 --> 00:15:01.000
I'm so sorry. Bal is excellent with the sword,
but has the intelligence of a rock.

00:15:01.710 --> 00:15:06.790
I doubt he even realizes that his words
may have troubled you in any way.

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.460
I figured.

00:15:08.830 --> 00:15:13.670
You might say he lacks communication skills,
or that he behaves based on instinct alone...

00:15:16.420 --> 00:15:18.130
Oh, but I did hear from my father,

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:24.000
that Bal attempted to return the sword granted
to the next head of House Riefenstahl,

00:15:24.880 --> 00:15:28.830
which means he wants to dissolve
his betrothal to one of my sisters.

00:15:29.250 --> 00:15:29.920
What?!

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:34.670
My father pleaded with him to reconsider,
and the decision has been put on hold for now,

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:38.040
but perhaps Bal is actually serious about you.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:48.500
Enough to toss aside his noble title, fiancée, knighthood,
and his family in order to devote himself to you.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:54.210
If he truly realizes how he feels,
he would go to such lengths.

00:15:54.540 --> 00:15:56.750
That's the kind of man he is.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.420
N-no, he can't do that!

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:01.250
Besides, I wouldn't want that!

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:02.580
I can't bear that kind of burden!

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:06.630
Of course not. The reason my sisters
don't want to get engaged to Bal

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:11.330
is because he lacks the acumen
to manage a political marriage.

00:16:11.880 --> 00:16:15.540
In any case, you needn't feel responsible, Miss Fiene.

00:16:16.210 --> 00:16:17.130
All right.

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:24.290
I was worrying about it alone for a while, so I feel
a little relieved getting it off my chest, Lady Lieselotte.

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:26.710
Thank you so much.

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:33.380
Th-this breeze is getting chilly. The tea party ends here.

00:16:34.330 --> 00:16:35.170
Right.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.040
Love is such a complicated matter.

00:16:46.830 --> 00:16:52.670
I might place an order with the same needleworker and
tie on a matching ribbon in purple and gold.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:01.670
This ribbon is a commission from His Highness himself.

00:17:01.960 --> 00:17:04.420
I shall see to it that it is perfect,

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:07.960
to uphold the honor of the Riefenstahl marquisate!

00:17:11.250 --> 00:17:14.630
Oh! Another stitch gone awry! I must undo it.

00:17:14.630 --> 00:17:16.170
How many ribbons has she done?

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:19.330
Why do you think she's like that?

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:25.380
You would think a fiancé would find it endearing
to get an embroidery that isn't quite perfect, you know?

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:26.580
Yeah, I agree.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:30.580
But I do hope His Highness understands.

00:17:30.920 --> 00:17:35.460
He'd better realize that our dear sister just
doesn't know how to say what she means,

00:17:35.920 --> 00:17:37.580
or he shouldn't get to marry her.

00:17:37.960 --> 00:17:39.080
Yes, exactly.

00:17:41.210 --> 00:17:43.420
It's only half a day's trip from here.

00:17:44.130 --> 00:17:44.830
Hmm?

00:17:45.250 --> 00:17:47.960
To the Riefenstahl estate,
where a certain someone is at the moment.

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:52.380
But we have to get going to the next estate tomorrow.

00:17:52.670 --> 00:17:55.380
Come on, you can't possibly be serious.

00:17:55.380 --> 00:17:55.920
Huh?

00:17:56.460 --> 00:17:58.750
Is that what you want for your last summer break ever?

00:17:59.380 --> 00:18:02.670
Once you graduate, you'll have even
less opportunity to go where you want.

00:18:03.080 --> 00:18:04.630
But as crown prince...

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:11.540
Deep down, you want to spend time with her
so you wished you could do the same as Fiene.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.710
You were jealous, weren't you?

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:16.710
Of course I understand you have your duties.

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.500
But if you don't tell her directly, she won't ever know.

00:18:22.460 --> 00:18:25.170
You've got to tell her when you miss her.

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:40.500
Even if I cannot see him, I want to do what
I can for him to the best of my ability.

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:44.380
I'll put my devotion for His Highness
into each and every stitch.

00:19:12.210 --> 00:19:13.080
What?!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.750
Is the place fully cleaned?

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:27.380
It will be very shortly!

00:19:27.750 --> 00:19:28.750
And the food?

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.420
The ingredients just arrived now!

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.330
Are the lirene flowers still not here?!

00:19:32.830 --> 00:19:34.080
They're here!

00:19:35.170 --> 00:19:38.920
Oh dear, perhaps a different dress
would have been better after all.

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:42.580
Don't worry. You look so very pretty!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:45.960
I'm sure Prince Siegwald will be swept off his feet.

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.580
Sieg! It's so good to see you!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:01.580
It's really been a while!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:04.790
It's wonderful to know someone can hear us!

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:09.080
Man, we have so much
we've been aching to tell you, Sieg!

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:16.580
Your Highness.

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:19.540
We bid you welcome.

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:25.080
I regret to inform you that our father
could not make it in time. I do apologize.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:26.580
Oh, please-

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:28.750
However...

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:33.790
I should point out that announcing your visit
a mere day in advance is much too sudden!

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:40.130
Ah, there she goes! Lieselotte is as prickly
as can be in front of Sieg, as always!

00:20:40.460 --> 00:20:43.460
With all due respect, I must say
I was shocked beyond belief.

00:20:43.710 --> 00:20:47.880
House Riefenstahl had the need to make certain
arrangements to prepare for your arrival.

00:20:48.130 --> 00:20:53.750
I'm sure you must agree, perhaps you had best consider
the situation at hand before taking such impulsive action!

00:20:54.420 --> 00:21:00.250
In other words, she means she didn't have nearly
enough time to prepare to greet her dearly beloved.

00:21:00.580 --> 00:21:02.330
Liese-tan got your letter,

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:06.380
then immediately gave the order to arrange a feast,
ran around to instruct the necessary arrangements,

00:21:03.130 --> 00:21:03.960
Right away!

00:21:06.540 --> 00:21:07.630
Are they ready?

00:21:06.710 --> 00:21:08.290
chose a dress,

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:11.330
got up at four to condition her skin to perfection,

00:21:11.630 --> 00:21:13.750
curled her hair, put on makeup,

00:21:14.170 --> 00:21:19.330
and put in a heart-melting amount of effort as
she fidgeted in eager anticipation of your arrival!

00:21:19.330 --> 00:21:22.750
So please forgive her for a few abrasive remarks.

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:25.290
Of course.

00:21:28.420 --> 00:21:30.210
I apologize for imposing on you like this.

00:21:30.790 --> 00:21:36.830
I knew it would inconvenience you, but still,
no matter what the cost, I wanted to come and see you.

00:21:40.040 --> 00:21:41.500
A critical hit!

00:21:41.500 --> 00:21:45.710
Wow, Sieg sure has gotten
the hang of how to treat Liese-tan!

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:48.000
You've got this down! Keep it coming!

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:52.210
Wow, look at all you cutie-pies!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:53.880
Any of you wanna marry me?

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:55.420
If you do, say-

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.170
What was that for?!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:03.880
You three had better return inside.
Before any damage can be done.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:08.380
Then why don't we get married, Fiene?

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:10.420
Let's serve the Church as man and wife!

00:22:10.420 --> 00:22:13.380
I can't. Priestesses aren't allowed to eat meat.

00:22:13.830 --> 00:22:15.460
That was a quick rejection...

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:23.420
S-some unknown intruder has destroyed the gates!

00:22:29.880 --> 00:22:30.920
Father?!

00:22:43.670 --> 00:22:49.630
Kurushiku kanjiru hodo mabushii hohoemi o

00:22:49.630 --> 00:22:55.290
Imadani massugu mirenai watashi

00:22:55.750 --> 00:23:01.880
Kokoro no fukaku de chirabatta kimochi o

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:07.540
Yukkuri atsumete yuku youni

00:23:08.500 --> 00:23:14.250
Yozora no hoshi ga subete o

00:23:15.250 --> 00:23:20.330
Miteruno? Shitteiruno?

00:23:21.420 --> 00:23:26.960
Mado o akete toikakeru

00:23:27.580 --> 00:23:30.960
Doushite?

00:23:32.750 --> 00:23:38.920
Kono sekai wa kagayaki de michiteiru

00:23:39.040 --> 00:23:45.040
Anata no egao ga oshiete kureta

00:23:45.040 --> 00:23:51.040
Shiawase na ketsumatsu o negatte shimau no

00:23:51.420 --> 00:24:01.250
Anata no soba ni ireta nara

00:24:01.250 --> 00:24:03.080
Itsumademo

00:24:07.460 --> 00:24:09.420
Itsumademo

00:24:13.670 --> 00:24:15.630
Sieg, you've gotta be more forward.

00:24:15.630 --> 00:24:16.710
What's this, Art?

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:19.330
If you fancy a girl, let your heart
do the talking and go right for it!

00:24:19.330 --> 00:24:21.290
Uh, I think you go for it way too often, Art.

00:24:21.290 --> 00:24:22.880
What? That's not true at all!

00:24:23.170 --> 00:24:25.080
Next Episode: Mother and Daughter,
Sisters, and a First Date.

00:24:24.920 --> 00:24:27.960
<b>Mother and Daughter, Sisters, and a First Date</b>

00:24:25.080 --> 00:24:26.460
Yes! Sounds like lots of girls next time!

00:24:26.460 --> 00:24:27.420
Oh, whatever.
